Lookout
=======

This project is a modified version of "siem-dashboard", copyright (c)
AngelaMos, released under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. It
remains licensed under the same license (see LICENSE). Original copyright
headers are preserved in the source files.

Modifications (AGPL-3.0 section 5(a)), made 2026-10-27:

  - Renamed the project from "siem-dashboard" to "Lookout" (distribution
    name "lookout-console").
  - Renamed the Python package backend/app to backend/lookout and the
    model modules from PascalCase to snake_case (Alert.py -> alert.py,
    LogEvent.py -> log_event.py, and so on); updated all imports.
  - Renamed container/project prefix, database name, Redis stream keys
    and consumer group, and frontend storage keys.
  - Changed default host ports, the internal backend port and the Docker
    network subnets.
  - Replaced the frontend color palette, brand mark, navigation labels,
    icons, web manifest and page metadata.
  - Removed the original screenshots and DEMO.md, which depicted the
    previous branding and linked to the original hosted demo.
  - Normalized line endings to LF and added .gitattributes.
  - Rewrote the README and adjusted the learn/ documents to match.

The ingestion, correlation, alerting and scenario logic is otherwise
unchanged from the original work.
